    <string name="settle_explain_title">How net whist is computed</string>
    <string name="settle_explain_text">1. Normalize: subtract the lowest mountain so the best player reaches 0.\n2. Convert: multiply each normalized mountain by 10 and divide by the number of players. Record that value in the whist column for each opponent.\n3. Net whist for a player = (whist they scored against others) − (whist others scored against them).</string>
